00:26:29.032 --> 00:26:30.002
- Thank you.

00:26:30.002 --> 00:26:31.530
- [Audience Member 3]
Really help us keep up.

00:26:31.530 --> 00:26:32.472
- Thank you.

00:26:32.472 --> 00:26:35.530
- [Audience Member 3] And my
question is how do you combine

00:26:35.530 --> 00:26:37.840
basically with about
the convenient operator

00:26:37.840 --> 00:26:39.990
and contributing so much content

00:26:39.990 --> 00:26:42.350
and the time to everything else?

00:26:42.350 --> 00:26:45.010
- Thank you for saying that, couple ways.

00:26:45.010 --> 00:26:50.010
One, I am very passionate
about giving back,

00:26:50.393 --> 00:26:54.430
giving back comes in the
form of financial give back.

00:26:54.430 --> 00:26:58.040
But ironically, I believe the
biggest way that I give back

00:26:58.040 --> 00:27:01.860
is by being intellectually generous,

00:27:01.860 --> 00:27:05.740
by putting out all my
content to the world for free

00:27:05.740 --> 00:27:08.610
I'm bringing people value.

00:27:08.610 --> 00:27:12.790
And so I compromise some
of my operational upside

00:27:12.790 --> 00:27:16.552
on my selfish side because
I allocate more time

00:27:16.552 --> 00:27:18.970
to put out content to the world.

00:27:18.970 --> 00:27:22.971
Comma I'm incredibly operationally strong.

00:27:22.971 --> 00:27:26.880
And I figured out many years
ago that if I just filmed

00:27:26.880 --> 00:27:29.610
every moment of my life,
even though in the beginning,

00:27:29.610 --> 00:27:31.332
it was gonna be very weird

00:27:31.332 --> 00:27:34.390
that it was a more efficient
model for me to create content

00:27:34.390 --> 00:27:35.830
that I could share to the world.

00:27:35.830 --> 00:27:38.705
I am one of the most prolific
content creators in the world

00:27:38.705 --> 00:27:41.214
and I never sit down and do content.

00:27:41.214 --> 00:27:44.600
I just actually live my
life and it just built.

00:27:44.600 --> 00:27:49.420
And so I think it comes from
the ambition to give back

00:27:49.420 --> 00:27:52.779
and from being actually a good operator.

00:27:52.779 --> 00:27:53.612
- [Audience Member 3] Thank you.

