Cheers.

00:28:02.320 --> 00:28:03.550
- [Ben] Hi Gary.

00:28:03.550 --> 00:28:04.383
- How are you?

00:28:04.383 --> 00:28:06.280
- [Ben] Good thank you.

00:28:06.280 --> 00:28:11.280
My name is Ben and I have
a silly question for you,

00:28:11.341 --> 00:28:13.285
which triggers me lot.

00:28:13.285 --> 00:28:18.285
Is it better to get in
your car and start driving

00:28:20.000 --> 00:28:22.173
or knowing where to go?

00:28:23.153 --> 00:28:25.445
- Hmm, that's a really fun question.

00:28:25.445 --> 00:28:29.920
I believe the answer is very individual.

00:28:29.920 --> 00:28:32.540
I believe if you're the kind of person

00:28:32.540 --> 00:28:36.534
that has spent too much time
thinking about where to go,

00:28:36.534 --> 00:28:39.670
that it's time to get in
the car and start driving.

00:28:39.670 --> 00:28:43.290
I believe that if you're a
person that continues to drive

00:28:43.290 --> 00:28:45.590
and you have no idea where you're going

00:28:45.590 --> 00:28:47.996
then it's time to pull
over and give some thought

00:28:47.996 --> 00:28:49.696
to think about where you're going.

